  ('130', '132', '81', NULL, 'MANUAL', '``` DIRECT ``` --- 논문: > diffusion process in compressed latent space > ↓ 코드: ``` x_start ``` 이 입력 latent. 실제 Stable Diffusion에서는: ``` Image ↓ VAE encode ↓ z latent ↓ DDPM ``` 순서. ---', NULL, 'true', '2026-08-11 17:57:52.858412+00', '2026-08-11 17:57:52.858412+00'),
  ('131', '133', '69', NULL, 'MANUAL', '``` DIRECT ``` --- 논문: > lower-dimensional latent representation > ↓ 코드: ``` self.encoder() ``` ↓ latent 생성 논문: > reconstruct image > ↓ 코드: ``` self.decoder() ``` ---', NULL, 'true', '2026-08-11 17:57:52.858412+00', '2026-08-11 17:57:52.858412+00'),
  ('132', '134', '69', NULL, 'MANUAL', '``` DIRECT ``` --- 논문: ``` encoder E decoder D ``` ↓ 코드: ``` self.encoder self.decoder ``` ---', NULL, 'true', '2026-08-11 17:57:52.858412+00', '2026-08-11 17:57:52.858412+00'),
  ('133', '135', '70', NULL, 'MANUAL', '``` DIRECT ``` --- 논문: > perceptual loss > ↓ 코드: ``` self.perceptual_loss() ``` ---', NULL, 'true', '2026-08-11 17:57:52.858412+00', '2026-08-11 17:57:52.858412+00'),
  ('134', '136', '71', NULL, 'MANUAL', '``` DIRECT ``` --- 논문: > KL-regulated autoencoder > ↓ 코드: ``` kl() ``` ---', NULL, 'true', '2026-08-11 17:57:52.858412+00', '2026-08-11 17:57:52.858412+00'),
  ('135', '137', '81', NULL, 'MANUAL', E'``` DIRECT ``` --- 논문: > gradual noising process > ↓ 코드: ``` q_sample() ``` ↓ Noise 추가 논문 수식: \\[ z_t = \\sqrt{\\bar{\\alpha_t}}z_0 + \\sqrt{1-\\bar{\\alpha_t}}\\epsilon \\] ↓ 코드: ``` sqrt_alphas_cumprod_t * x_start + sqrt_one_minus_alphas_cumprod_t * noise ``` ---', NULL, 'true', '2026-08-11 17:57:52.858412+00', '2026-08-11 17:57:52.858412+00'),
  ('136', '138', '81', NULL, 'MANUAL', '``` DIRECT ``` --- 논문: > reverse diffusion process > ↓ 코드: ``` p_sample() ``` 논문: > predicting noise > ↓ 코드: ``` self.model() ``` (UNet 호출) ---', NULL, 'true', '2026-08-11 17:57:52.858412+00', '2026-08-11 17:57:52.858412+00'),
  ('137', '139', '72', NULL, 'MANUAL', '``` DIRECT ``` --- 논문: > UNet architecture > ↓ 코드: ``` UNetModel ``` 논문: > downsampling and upsampling blocks > ↓ 코드: ``` input_blocks output_blocks ``` 논문: > attention layers > ↓ 코드: ``` SpatialTransformer ``` ---', NULL, 'true', '2026-08-11 17:57:52.858412+00', '2026-08-11 17:57:52.858412+00'),
  ('138', '140', '73', NULL, 'MANUAL', '``` DIRECT ``` --- 논문: > residual blocks > ↓ 코드: ``` class ResBlock ``` Residual 연결: 논문: ``` input + residual ``` ↓ 코드: ``` return self.skip_connection(x)+h ``` ---', NULL, 'true', '2026-08-11 17:57:52.858412+00', '2026-08-11 17:57:52.858412+00'),
  ('139', '141', '74', NULL, 'MANUAL', '``` DIRECT ``` --- 논문: > attention layers > ↓ 코드: ``` AttentionBlock ``` Residual: ``` x+h ``` ---', NULL, 'true', '2026-08-11 17:57:52.858412+00', '2026-08-11 17:57:52.858412+00'),
  ('140', '142', '75', NULL, 'MANUAL', '``` DIRECT ``` --- 논문: > cross-attention layers > ↓ 코드: ``` CrossAttention ``` Query: ``` self.to_q() ``` Text: ``` self.to_k() self.to_v() ``` ---', NULL, 'true', '2026-08-11 17:57:52.858412+00', '2026-08-11 17:57:52.858412+00'),
