  ('235', '246', '132', NULL, 'MANUAL', '``` DIRECT ``` --- 논문: ``` SAM consists of: - image encoder - prompt encoder - mask decoder ``` ↓ 코드: ``` self.image_encoder self.prompt_encoder self.mask_decoder ``` ↓ 실행: ``` image_embeddings = self.image_encoder() sparse_embeddings, dense_embeddings = self.prompt_encoder() masks = self.mask_decoder() ``` ---', NULL, 'true', '2026-08-11 17:57:53.623712+00', '2026-08-11 17:57:53.623712+00'),
  ('236', '247', '133', NULL, 'MANUAL', '``` DIRECT ``` --- 논문: ``` ViT computes image embedding ``` ↓ 코드: ``` self.patch_embed() for blk in self.blocks: self.neck() ``` ↓ 결과: ``` Image Embedding ``` ---', NULL, 'true', '2026-08-11 17:57:53.623712+00', '2026-08-11 17:57:53.623712+00'),
  ('237', '248', '134', NULL, 'MANUAL', '``` DIRECT ``` --- 논문: ``` Image encoder receives image input and produces image embedding. ``` ↓ 코드: ``` self.proj = nn.Conv2d(...) ``` ↓ 이미지를 patch 단위 feature map으로 변환 논문 개념: ``` Image Patch Tokenization ``` 코드: ``` Conv2d with kernel=stride=patch size ``` ---', NULL, 'true', '2026-08-11 17:57:53.623712+00', '2026-08-11 17:57:53.623712+00'),
  ('238', '249', '135', NULL, 'MANUAL', '``` DIRECT ``` --- 논문: ``` ViT encoder computes image representation ``` ↓ 코드: ``` for blk in self.blocks: x = blk(x) ``` ↓ 각 Transformer Block 수행 ---', NULL, 'true', '2026-08-11 17:57:53.623712+00', '2026-08-11 17:57:53.623712+00'),
  ('239', '250', '136', NULL, 'MANUAL', '``` DIRECT ``` --- 논문: ``` ViT image encoder ``` ↓ 코드: ``` Attention.forward() ``` ↓ 구현: ``` Q,K,V 생성 ↓ Attention score 계산 ↓ Feature aggregation ``` ---', NULL, 'true', '2026-08-11 17:57:53.623712+00', '2026-08-11 17:57:53.623712+00'),
  ('240', '251', '137', NULL, 'MANUAL', '``` DIRECT ``` --- 논문: ``` Sparse prompts and dense prompts ``` ↓ 코드: ``` _embed_points() _embed_boxes() _embed_masks() ``` ---', NULL, 'true', '2026-08-11 17:57:53.623712+00', '2026-08-11 17:57:53.623712+00'),
  ('241', '252', '137', NULL, 'MANUAL', '``` DIRECT ``` --- 논문: ``` point prompts are represented as positional encodings with learned embeddings ``` ↓ 코드: ``` self.pe_layer.forward_with_coords() ``` ↓ 좌표 embedding 생성 그리고: ``` self.point_embeddings ``` ↓ positive / negative point label embedding 추가 ---', NULL, 'true', '2026-08-11 17:57:53.623712+00', '2026-08-11 17:57:53.623712+00'),
  ('242', '253', '137', NULL, 'MANUAL', '``` DIRECT ``` --- 논문: ``` box prompt ``` ↓ 코드: ``` boxes.reshape( -1, 2, 2 ) ``` ↓ 두 개 corner point 생성 ↓ ``` point_embeddings[2] point_embeddings[3] ``` ↓ box corner embedding ---', NULL, 'true', '2026-08-11 17:57:53.623712+00', '2026-08-11 17:57:53.623712+00'),
